  "notes": "DAW mode: V2 runs transport, faders (track volume), main knob and display. Knobs 1-8 (CC 16-23, relative) drive parameters 1-8 of the focused plugin, any plugin. Switches automatically from/to 'keylab61' when the KeyLab changes mode. Knobs only drive a plugin while a plugin window is focused; otherwise (and in V2 mixer mode) V2 handles them (mixer pan). Faders 1-8 (pitch bend ch 1-8) = mixer inserts of the bank (V2's bank in V2 mixer mode); fader 9 = selected track.",
